00:51:08.829 --> 00:51:15.130
And here are some papers that I touched on
when describing the methods here.

00:51:15.130 --> 00:51:23.319
The first paper that describes all these active
deep learning architectures has been submitted

00:51:23.319 --> 00:51:27.289
to the Clinical Research Informatics at AMIA.

00:51:27.289 --> 00:51:39.140
The second paper was just presented in November
